      "id": "claim_fb61df0e01df4539b2fb0d6377caaea3",
      "statement": "wargear-parser.ts (labelled §7.1) exposes compileWahapediaWargear(rawTextOrHtml: string): WargearRuleAST[] from the package barrel as a pure, line-oriented regex matcher with no database, points-table, or configuration input; its input in production is the joined rawText of a datasheet's wargearRules rows (CatalogUnit.wargearRulesRaw) or hard-coded demo prose.",
